			"I've spent most of my birthdays alone. I'm quite far from home, and it's not like I've made many friends I've not left behind in my travels. However, it seems like my achievements have resonated with the people. Under a snow-covered centennial tree besides a frozen fountain in the town square, a little girl gifted me a handmade plushie of me!"
